{"n": 459, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "459.webp", "text": "26-6\n\n2611051 REPLACING JOINT DISC FOR\nREAR PROPELLER SHAFT\n\nLoosen threaded sleeve several turns with\nSpecial Tool 26 1 040\n\nfastaliavon\n\nTighten threaded sleeve with Special Toot\n26 1040 after finishing installation\nTightening torque*\n\nRemove primary and final mufflers 18 12 000.\nUnscrew heat shield.\n\nSince 1983 Models:\nUnscrew connector\n\nCars with 4 HP 22 Automatic Transmission\nSupport transmission with Special Tools\n24 0 120 and 00 2 020\n\nUnscrew transmission suspension.\n\nInstallation\nAlso bolt on holder for oxygen sensor plug on\ncars with catalytic converter\n\nUnscrew propeller shaft on transmission\n\nUnscrew heat shield\n\nInstallation\n\nCheck for sufficient space between tank and\nheat shield\n\nlastaliavion\n\nReplace stop nuts.\n\nTightening torque*\n\nImportant!\n\nOnly turn on nuts and bolts on flange side\nwhenever permitted by design, to avoid stress\nin coupling\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["26-6", 0.4797, 0.0219, 0.5334, 0.0451], ["2611051", 0.268, 0.0663, 0.3156, 0.0763], ["REPLACING", 0.3303, 0.0663, 0.3931, 0.0769], ["JOINT", 0.3967, 0.0663, 0.4281, 0.0763], ["DISC", 0.4326, 0.0663, 0.4569, 0.0763], ["FOR", 0.4615, 0.0663, 0.4833, 0.0763], ["REAR", 0.3303, 0.0822, 0.3597, 0.0922], ["PROPELLER", 0.3642, 0.0822, 0.4281, 0.0928], ["SHAFT", 0.4321, 0.0822, 0.4676, 0.0928], ["Loosen", 0.7619, 0.0703, 0.7974, 0.0802], ["threaded", 0.8014, 0.0696, 0.8425, 0.0796], ["sleeve", 0.847, 0.0696, 0.8744, 0.0789], ["several", 0.8779, 0.0696, 0.9088, 0.0789], ["turns", 0.9134, 0.071, 0.9367, 0.0782], ["with", 0.9407, 0.0696, 0.961, 0.0782], ["Special", 0.7614, 0.0849, 0.7958, 0.0975], ["Tool", 0.7999, 0.0849, 0.8217, 0.0955], ["26", 0.8257, 0.0849, 0.8374, 0.0955], ["1", 0.8425, 0.0849, 0.846, 0.0942], ["040", 0.8506, 0.0849, 0.8683, 0.0948], ["fastaliavon", 0.7614, 0.1021, 0.8166, 0.1114], ["Tighten", 0.7619, 0.1167, 0.7994, 0.13], ["threaded", 0.8034, 0.1174, 0.845